<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary credits.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned the all three credit auctions in the secondary market whereby it sought to inject 5.668 billion pesos.</p>
<p>The credits were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>CREDIT AUCTIONS   TERM     MAX    MIN    AVERAGE  BIDS BIDDERS</p>
<p>2.334  bln pesos  4 days   30.01  29.85  29.98    5    3</p>
<p>2.334  bln pesos  2 days   29.90  29.86  29.88    6    4</p>
<p>1.000  bln pesos  1 days   29.85  29.81  29.83    3    3</p>
<p>NOTE - The maximum, minimum and average are percentages.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9500</p>
</text>
